## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **1. DomainUrl matching strategy:** For `/resolve`, should we match `DomainUrl` exactly (e.g., `http://localhost:4201`) or do a **contains/prefix** match? I recommend exact match after normalizing (strip trailing slash, lowercase). Confirm?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **2. `/resolve` caching:** Should the `/resolve` endpoint response also be cached (in-memory by origin URL) to avoid DB hits on every app bootstrap? The tenant middleware cache already handles subsequent requests, but `/resolve` itself hits the DB each time. I recommend adding a short cache (5 min) for resolve lookups.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **3. Per-tenant JWT — Phase 1 or Phase 2?** The per-tenant JWT isolation is a significant change to the auth pipeline. Should we implement it now as part of this PR, or defer it to a follow-up? The multi-tenant middleware works perfectly fine with the current shared JWT config — per-tenant JWT is an isolation enhancement. My recommendation: implement the infrastructure (env var resolution + `ITenantContext` JWT fields) now, but keep the `AuthenticationExtension` dynamic validation as a Phase 2 if you want to reduce risk.

